OL,3,GNEWSAKnock-on effects if maternity
OL,4,Aservices suspended, trust chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf plans for a temporary suspension of
OL,7,Fmaternity services go ahead at Daisy
OL,8,FHill hospital, there could be "knock-on
OL,9,Feffects" at Craigavon Area Hosptial,
OL,10,Fthe Southern Trust's chief executive
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FSteve Spoerry said they "don't want
OL,14,Fthis to happen" but it "looks more
OL,15,Flikely than not" that it will.
OL,17,FOn Monday the trust, which oversees the
OL,18,Fhospital, said it has not been able to
OL,19,Frecruit consultant obstetricians to
OL,20,Ffill vacancies at the hospital.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
