OL,3,GNEWSAKnock-on effects if maternity
OL,4,Aservices suspended, trust chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is preparing to temporarily move
OL,7,Finpatient maternity services to
OL,8,FCraigavon and, if plans go ahead, no
OL,9,Fbabies will be delivered at Daisy Hill
OL,10,FHospital in Newry.
